{"t":"QUBT","made":"2026-11-19 01:25","name":"Quantum Computing Inc.","ko":"퀀텀컴퓨팅","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","employees":72,"hq":"Hoboken, NJ, United States","website":"https://www.quantumcomputinginc.com","summary_en":"Quantum Computing Inc., an integrated photonics company, provides quantum machines to commercial and government markets in the United States. The company develops thin-film lithium niobate chips for optical devices, such as electro-optical modulators, periodically poled devices for frequency conversion, and micro-ring resonator cavities markets. It is also developing the entropy quantum computer (EQC), a quantum application of Core Photonics Technology, designed to solve complex optimization problems. In addition, the company offers Emucore, a reservoir computing machine that can be reprogrammed after manufacturing and optimized for recurrent neural network applications; Neurawave, a photonics based reservoir computer; LiDAR, which allows machines to see through dense fog and provide image fidelity at great distances in environments, such as snow, ice, and water; the quantum photonic vibrometer, an instrument for remote vibration detection, sensing, and inspection; and quantum networks and quantum authentication products. The company was formerly known as Innovative Beverage Group Holdings, Inc. Quantum Computing, Inc. was founded in 2001 and is based in Hoboken, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"통합 포토닉스 회사인 Quantum Computing Inc.는 미국의 상업 및 정부 시장에 양자 기계를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 전기광학 변조기, 주파수 변환을 위한 주기적 극 장치, 마이크로 링 공진기 공동 시장과 같은 광학 장치용 박막 리튬 니오베이트 칩을 개발합니다. 복잡한 최적화 문제를 해결하기 위해 설계된 코어포토닉스 기술(Core Photonics Technology)을 양자 응용한 엔트로피 양자컴퓨터(EQC)도 개발 중이다. 또한 이 회사는 제조 후 재프로그래밍이 가능하고 순환 신경망 애플리케이션에 최적화될 수 있는 저장소 컴퓨팅 머신인 Emucore를 제공합니다. 포토닉스 기반 저장소 컴퓨터인 Neurawave; 눈, 얼음, 물과 같은 환경에서 기계가 짙은 안개를 뚫고 먼 거리에서도 이미지 충실도를 제공할 수 있게 해주는 LiDAR 원격 진동 감지, 감지 및 검사를 위한 장비인 양자 광진동계; 및 양자 네트워크 및 양자 인증 제품. 이 회사는 이전에 Innovative Beverage Group Holdings, Inc.로 알려져 있었습니다. Quantum Computing, Inc.는 2001년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지주 호보켄에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":5.1201,"mcap":1161913344.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-18.071154,"peg":null,"ps":61.34706,"pb":0.73543525,"ev_ebitda":-3.863,"div":0.0,"beta":3.919,"hi52":14.45,"lo52":4.9},"fin":{"rev":18940000.0,"rev_g":23.74,"eps_g":null,"gross":-0.08221,"op":-4.54403,"net":-1.7161599,"roe":-0.02645,"fcf":-62389624.0,"cash":901614016.0,"debt":27310000.0,"de":1.729,"eps":-0.13,"feps":-0.28333},"own":{"short":0.3439,"inst":0.48106998,"insider":0.12126},"analyst":{"n":6,"mean":18.0,"median":16.0,"high":32.0,"low":10.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.66667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":22.0,"priorPriceTarget":22.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-26","Firm":"Ascendiant Capital","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":32.0,"priorPriceTarget":30.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-11","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":10.0,"priorPriceTarget":10.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-06-29","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":22.0,"priorPriceTarget":22.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-06-24","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":22.0,"priorPriceTarget":22.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-06-15","Firm":"Ascendiant Capital","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceT